      "text": "A girl in Manila pays for coffee with the yield she earned.\nPosts the receipt on @cookiedotfun.\nGets $VEERA.\nBuys groceries.\nPosts again.\nSomeone in Lagos sees it, signs up, repeats.\nNo ads.\nNo KOLs.\nJust real stories → real users → real volume.\n@On_Veera becomes the first app where money spreads faster by people telling the truth about it than by banks printing it.\nCookie lights the match.\nVeera is the fire.\nThe future of finance isn’t built.\nIt’s told.\nAnd everyone who says it gets paid.\nThat’s the whole vision.\nShort enough to fit on a cookie.",
